{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","group":"90","path":"90/meta/glossary.md","title":"glossary","display":"glossary","type":"note","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<h1 id=\"90-Glossary-—-接口与记号术语表\">90 Glossary — 接口与记号术语表</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>版本</strong>：1.5<br>\n<strong>书籍</strong>：Diagonalization and Self-Reference（90）<br>\n<strong>更新日期</strong>：2026-09-17<br>\n<strong>定义来源</strong>：以链接文件的 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准；本表不覆盖其中的参数和类型条件。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"使用约定\">使用约定</h2>\n<p>同一推导固定签名S、指定变量v、编码/部分解码(g,d)、演算和理论T。省略下标不允许中途切换这些参数。元语言代码g(φ)是自然数，数码是对象语言项；元语言可证关系与对象语言可证性公式不是可交换的记号。</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>记号/接口</th>\n<th>精确用途与边界</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>L_arith</code>、<code>S_arith</code>、<code>ar</code></td>\n<td>原有扁平签名及其元数映射；标准结构另有解释分量。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Var_L</code>、<code>Term_L</code>、<code>AtFml_L</code>、<code>FreeFor_L</code></td>\n<td>通过分层签名翻译调用88语法；自由代入条件和新鲜变量选择显式给出。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Fml_L</code>、<code>Fml_L^(r)</code>、<code>Fml_L[vec x]</code></td>\n<td>分别为全公式集、恰有指定r个自由变量的公式、自由变量包含于指定表的公式。上标不是88的构造深度。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SubSpec_L</code>、<code>Sub^ca_L</code>、同时代入</td>\n<td>捕获避免替换的全部递归分支、指定新鲜变量选择和有限同时替换；不依赖说明文字补分支。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Expr(L)</code>、<code>in_i</code>、<code>dTerm</code>、<code>dFml</code>、<code>dSeq</code></td>\n<td>带类型载体、嵌入和部分解码分量；公式代码的解码须取公式分量，不能把标签对当作公式。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>VList</code>、<code>ucl</code>、有限量词列</td>\n<td>有序有限变量表、全称闭包及量词折叠的实际定义；空列分支在正文。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>FV</code>、<code>Sent_S</code></td>\n<td>自由变量集与无自由变量公式。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5385f3fe07cb98ef\" href=\"?note=5385f3fe07cb98ef\" title=\"90-df-free-variable\">90-df-free-variable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>FOL_=(L)</code>、<code>MP</code>、<code>Gen</code>、<code>Ax</code>、<code>Rules</code></td>\n<td>原等号演算三元组和规则接口；有限推导、逻辑公理与T扩张明确区分。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GN_E(g,d)</code></td>\n<td>相对于所声明字串呈示的有效单射编码、可判定合法码集和像集上的部分解码。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"4de0ebda11529dc6\" href=\"?note=4de0ebda11529dc6\" title=\"90-df-effective-procedure\">90-df-effective-procedure</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>g(E)</code>、尖引号码</td>\n<td>表达式代码是自然数；将它放进公式时使用对应数码。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"5e705f7962c302c2\" href=\"?note=5e705f7962c302c2\" title=\"90-df-godel-number\">90-df-godel-number</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"9a1dfd8bac56a4d9\" href=\"?note=9a1dfd8bac56a4d9\" title=\"90-df-quotation-function\">90-df-quotation-function</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bar n</code>、<code>bar vec n</code></td>\n<td>对象语言中的S迭代闭项及其逐坐标有限列，不是元语言自然数或自然数列。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Sub_S(a,n)</code></td>\n<td>固定g和v的一元公式代码替换；合法公式类明确为自由变量恰是该v，非法代码用原默认值0。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"7279c20158ac140e\" href=\"?note=7279c20158ac140e\" title=\"90-df-substitution-function\">90-df-substitution-function</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>D</code>、<code>norm</code>、<code>SmDiag</code></td>\n<td>各原有接口均封装Sub_S(e,e)；不是任意公式已经得到的语义不动点。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"9aaef8df4fb1222b\" href=\"?note=9aaef8df4fb1222b\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-function\">90-df-diagonal-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"72adf94db165e486\" href=\"?note=72adf94db165e486\" title=\"90-df-norm\">90-df-norm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"fb8a113c2891ff19\" href=\"?note=fb8a113c2891ff19\" title=\"90-df-smullyan-diagonal\">90-df-smullyan-diagonal</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>diag(F)</code></td>\n<td>函数x↦F(x,x)，不是集合。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"acbe50cee0754d98\" href=\"?note=acbe50cee0754d98\" title=\"90-df-diagonalization\">90-df-diagonalization</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Diag(S)</code></td>\n<td>固定D下的像D[S]，一般不是闭包算子。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"e30651fa49cc3e16\" href=\"?note=e30651fa49cc3e16\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-closure\">90-df-diagonal-closure</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DiagAdeq_{S,g,d}(T)</code></td>\n<td>保留Q扩张、编码有效、替换PR以及原有StrongRep等充分条件；不默认来自有效公理化。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SelfRef_T(ψ;φ)</code></td>\n<td>固定同一编码和数码的T内可证等价关系。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-22\" data-note=\"af4f7551b0885593\" href=\"?note=af4f7551b0885593\" title=\"90-df-self-reference\">90-df-self-reference</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Mentions_S(σ,n)</code>、<code>SynSelfRef_{S,g}(σ)</code></td>\n<td>语法树中的字面自引用条件，与可证固定点条件不同。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-23\" data-note=\"6763f8a85fa6a7b0\" href=\"?note=6763f8a85fa6a7b0\" title=\"90-df-self-referential-sentence\">90-df-self-referential-sentence</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>PartRec</code>、<code>Rec</code>、<code>PartRec_k</code>、<code>Rec_k</code></td>\n<td>分别为部分/全可计算谓词及按元数的函数类。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-24\" data-note=\"8105afc544202519\" href=\"?note=8105afc544202519\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function\">90-df-recursive-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-25\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>RecPred_k</code>、<code>χ_P</code></td>\n<td>特征函数取1/0的递归关系类。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-26\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>PR</code>、<code>PR_k</code>、<code>Base</code></td>\n<td>原有正元基础族的类型化闭包；本书PR_0为空，不擅自加入零元函数。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-27\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Comp</code>、<code>PrimRec</code></td>\n<td>前者保留正元数，后者递归参数在最后；函数图保证存在唯一。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-28\" data-note=\"1fd3a0e014d33285\" href=\"?note=1fd3a0e014d33285\" title=\"90-df-composition-operator\">90-df-composition-operator</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-29\" data-note=\"ac2460aba5c368e5\" href=\"?note=ac2460aba5c368e5\" title=\"90-df-primrec-operator\">90-df-primrec-operator</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Z</code>、<code>S</code>、<code>π_i^n</code></td>\n<td>一元零函数、后继和原有编号的投影。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-30\" data-note=\"9f760cc852de5c08\" href=\"?note=9f760cc852de5c08\" title=\"90-df-zero-function\">90-df-zero-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-31\" data-note=\"b769360437f9e54a\" href=\"?note=b769360437f9e54a\" title=\"90-df-successor-function\">90-df-successor-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-32\" data-note=\"4d499aedd34b7bfd\" href=\"?note=4d499aedd34b7bfd\" title=\"90-df-projection-function\">90-df-projection-function</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Cond(c,a,b)</code></td>\n<td>仅c=1取a；其余所有自然数条件值取b。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-33\" data-note=\"26d87d9e35a83cd9\" href=\"?note=26d87d9e35a83cd9\" title=\"90-df-conditional-function\">90-df-conditional-function</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pred</code>、<code>sub</code></td>\n<td>前驱与截断减法；pred通过元数正确的辅助原始递归定义。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-34\" data-note=\"1e6602d1acf4aceb\" href=\"?note=1e6602d1acf4aceb\" title=\"90-df-subtraction-function\">90-df-subtraction-function</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>`a</td>\n<td>b<code>、</code>Prime<code>、</code>p_i`</td>\n<td>整除、素数及从p_1=2开始的素数序列；不使用未定义Div谓词。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>div(x,y)</code>、<code>rem(x,y)</code></td>\n<td>商余唯一值；零除数分支按原定义取(0,x)。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-35\" data-note=\"f0ea0e26dd8bcf09\" href=\"?note=f0ea0e26dd8bcf09\" title=\"90-df-divrem-function\">90-df-divrem-function</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SeqCode(s,n)</code>、<code>Seq</code>、<code>Len</code>、<code>(s)_i</code></td>\n<td>二元编码长度关系及其派生接口；90素数积码空列为1，非法/越界默认值明确。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-36\" data-note=\"5dc32170bd55a322\" href=\"?note=5dc32170bd55a322\" title=\"90-df-sequence-encoding\">90-df-sequence-encoding</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-37\" data-note=\"4293e1643a9254d8\" href=\"?note=4293e1643a9254d8\" title=\"90-df-sequence\">90-df-sequence</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前缀、追加</td>\n<td>原接口在合法序列码上取前i项、追加单个数值m；不是88编码，也不是两数值码拼接。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-38\" data-note=\"80418eede5544150\" href=\"?note=80418eede5544150\" title=\"90-df-prefix-projection\">90-df-prefix-projection</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-39\" data-note=\"a24d8667957b1216\" href=\"?note=a24d8667957b1216\" title=\"90-df-sequence-concatenation\">90-df-sequence-concatenation</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Pfx</code>、<code>App</code></td>\n<td>新增全PR辅助函数，为非法码给出默认值，不改变原前缀/追加输入域。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-40\" data-note=\"1cdf7925a164f89d\" href=\"?note=1cdf7925a164f89d\" title=\"90-lem-sequence-coding\">90-lem-sequence-coding</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Conf_M</code>、<code>Step_M</code></td>\n<td>半无限纸带配置；左边界移动到0仍在0，终态无后继。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-41\" data-note=\"3953b8fffc6e6551\" href=\"?note=3953b8fffc6e6551\" title=\"90-df-configuration\">90-df-configuration</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ProgCode</code>、<code>CCode</code>、<code>EncConf</code>、<code>DecConf</code></td>\n<td>固定程序和配置数码；非法程序码解释为统一循环机。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-42\" data-note=\"01ab533da9c8c517\" href=\"?note=01ab533da9c8c517\" title=\"90-df-machine-coding\">90-df-machine-coding</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>CompCode</code>、<code>HaltSeq</code></td>\n<td>前者验证输入初态和步关系；后者验证合法配置列及末态。配置对象先解码，不把自然数直接当三元组。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-43\" data-note=\"61f71a91e63627ba\" href=\"?note=61f71a91e63627ba\" title=\"90-df-compcode\">90-df-compcode</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-44\" data-note=\"4a2564848c03103c\" href=\"?note=4a2564848c03103c\" title=\"90-df-haltseq\">90-df-haltseq</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>T(e,vec x,y)</code>、<code>T_k</code>、<code>U(y)</code></td>\n<td>本书具体有限终止历史关系和全输出提取；不是任意PR关系/函数的占位符。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-45\" data-note=\"48b1cea94ba27d41\" href=\"?note=48b1cea94ba27d41\" title=\"90-df-t-predicate\">90-df-t-predicate</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-46\" data-note=\"01ab533da9c8c517\" href=\"?note=01ab533da9c8c517\" title=\"90-df-machine-coding\">90-df-machine-coding</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>φ_e^(k)</code>、<code>Φ</code>、<code>W_e</code></td>\n<td>同一本书固定编号；W_e为一元φ_e的定义域。跨书相同e不意味着相同程序。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-47\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-48\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>φ_{e,s}</code>、<code>W_{e,s}</code></td>\n<td>在固定历史码界和输入界下的阶段近似；与极限图的联系显式给出。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-49\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分值相等、收敛/发散</td>\n<td>相等允许两侧均未定义；有值相等以函数图成员关系解释。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-50\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-51\" data-note=\"725681f54d4cc140\" href=\"?note=725681f54d4cc140\" title=\"90-df-halt-notation\">90-df-halt-notation</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>μ</code></td>\n<td>第一定义最小化全函数的零点；广义定义最小化任意关系的见证，数学存在性与计算可实现性分开。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-52\" data-note=\"65cecff06a8bc84e\" href=\"?note=65cecff06a8bc84e\" title=\"90-df-min-operator\">90-df-min-operator</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-53\" data-note=\"523fadf1703582fe\" href=\"?note=523fadf1703582fe\" title=\"90-df-min-operator-generalized\">90-df-min-operator-generalized</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Q</code>、<code>PA</code>、<code>IΣ_n</code></td>\n<td>原理论对象保留；归纳模式的自由参数全称闭包明确。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-54\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-55\" data-note=\"4c3a40ac2277e7d0\" href=\"?note=4c3a40ac2277e7d0\" title=\"90-df-peano-arithmetic\">90-df-peano-arithmetic</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-56\" data-note=\"c61fe71286984490\" href=\"?note=c61fe71286984490\" title=\"90-df-isigma-hierarchy\">90-df-isigma-hierarchy</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>L_PR</code>、<code>QF(L_PR)</code>、<code>PRA</code></td>\n<td>由有限PR构造描述引入函数符号及方程，加原有无量词归纳；不按外延函数相等判定语法。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-57\" data-note=\"93165ca56749f325\" href=\"?note=93165ca56749f325\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive-presentations\">90-df-primitive-recursive-presentations</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-58\" data-note=\"62294d1c4025d5d8\" href=\"?note=62294d1c4025d5d8\" title=\"90-df-pra\">90-df-pra</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Represents_T(X,φ)</code>、<code>NumExpress_T(X,φ)</code></td>\n<td>按完整自由参数表对标准元组的正、负逐数表示。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-59\" data-note=\"635265d0fe56f718\" href=\"?note=635265d0fe56f718\" title=\"90-df-representation\">90-df-representation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-60\" data-note=\"af98bb2babeee14b\" href=\"?note=af98bb2babeee14b\" title=\"90-df-numeralwise-express\">90-df-numeralwise-express</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>StrongRep_T(f,φ)</code></td>\n<td>在图的逐数表示之外，要求T统一证明所有输入存在唯一输出；不能由一般递归函数的图可表示性直接推出。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-61\" data-note=\"cc78339b84b14c7b\" href=\"?note=cc78339b84b14c7b\" title=\"90-df-strong-representation\">90-df-strong-representation</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>REAx_{S,g}(T)</code></td>\n<td>T是句子公理集且其代码c.e.；不要求公理集合本身可判定。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-62\" data-note=\"002c574215686062\" href=\"?note=002c574215686062\" title=\"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory\">90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>LineIndex_T</code>、<code>PrfAdeq_T</code></td>\n<td>同一行验证程序及内部证明公式的选择条件；存在性不伪装成唯一选择。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-63\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ProofCode_T(p,n)</code></td>\n<td>固定行验证器及有限计算证书下的外部PR关系。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-64\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Prf_T(u,v)</code>、<code>Prov_T(v)</code></td>\n<td>同一实际证明码关系的Σ1逐数表示公式，以及它对证明码变量的存在量化。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-65\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>HBL_T(P)</code>、原调用<code>HB(T,P)</code></td>\n<td>对同一个P的三条可推导性条件；标准模型正确或逐数表示本身不自动给出这些条件。89原依赖保留。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-66\" data-note=\"8d9c15743f7342d2\" href=\"?note=8d9c15743f7342d2\" title=\"90-df-hbl-conditions\">90-df-hbl-conditions</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-67\" data-note=\"7145c12676268ab1\" href=\"?note=7145c12676268ab1\" title=\"90-thm-second-incompleteness\">90-thm-second-incompleteness</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bot</code>、元一致性、<code>Con_T</code></td>\n<td>bot保留为0=S0；元一致性为T不能证明bot，内部Con为对应Prov实例的否定。一般一致性连接需T证明非bot。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-68\" data-note=\"4e89323a1592aeb9\" href=\"?note=4e89323a1592aeb9\" title=\"90-df-consistency-statement\">90-df-consistency-statement</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ω-Con(T)</code>、<code>1-Con(T)</code></td>\n<td>前者原有限推导下的ω一致性，后者原定义的Σ1可靠性；不是同一个谓词。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-69\" data-note=\"afba846451d1e711\" href=\"?note=afba846451d1e711\" title=\"90-df-omega-consistency\">90-df-omega-consistency</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-70\" data-note=\"c0383e348990de99\" href=\"?note=c0383e348990de99\" title=\"90-df-1-consistency\">90-df-1-consistency</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OmegaCl</code>、带ω下标的可证关系</td>\n<td>允许无限前提的ω规则闭包，与普通有限Hilbert可证性分开。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-71\" data-note=\"33c947461e9585e1\" href=\"?note=33c947461e9585e1\" title=\"90-df-omega-rule\">90-df-omega-rule</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Godel</code>、<code>Rosser</code>、<code>Henkin</code>相关句子接口</td>\n<td>使用同一g、数码、Prf及Prov；各自独立性/可证性条件在相应定理列明。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-72\" data-note=\"b2b5974a0bdc4e1b\" href=\"?note=b2b5974a0bdc4e1b\" title=\"90-df-godel-sentence\">90-df-godel-sentence</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-73\" data-note=\"7c51b51998a67f02\" href=\"?note=7c51b51998a67f02\" title=\"90-df-rosser-sentence\">90-df-rosser-sentence</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-74\" data-note=\"c4cc1405929acfc1\" href=\"?note=c4cc1405929acfc1\" title=\"90-df-henkin-sentence\">90-df-henkin-sentence</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>True</code>、<code>TruthDef</code>、<code>TarskiUndef</code></td>\n<td>外部满足关系、相对结构的内部定义以及同一算术语言的不可定义性，不混同扩张语言的真理谓词。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-75\" data-note=\"ead6ebad4464a6c6\" href=\"?note=ead6ebad4464a6c6\" title=\"90-df-truth-predicate\">90-df-truth-predicate</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-76\" data-note=\"f63672a7ac0e50d2\" href=\"?note=f63672a7ac0e50d2\" title=\"90-df-truth-definition\">90-df-truth-definition</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-77\" data-note=\"ee92d67ceb6220d0\" href=\"?note=ee92d67ceb6220d0\" title=\"90-df-tarski-undefinability\">90-df-tarski-undefinability</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Arith(Syn,g)</code></td>\n<td>相对于已声明的语法运算族与关系族的算术化条件。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-78\" data-note=\"fac5c810f5035179\" href=\"?note=fac5c810f5035179\" title=\"90-df-arithmetization\">90-df-arithmetization</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Normal</code>、<code>GodelSys</code></td>\n<td>保留原呈示对象、编码与表示条件；隐藏参数现在必须在调用环境固定。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-79\" data-note=\"f93e27fe7f2babaf\" href=\"?note=f93e27fe7f2babaf\" title=\"90-df-normal-system\">90-df-normal-system</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-80\" data-note=\"9f8586e4baa616ce\" href=\"?note=9f8586e4baa616ce\" title=\"90-df-godel-system-definition\">90-df-godel-system-definition</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-81\" data-note=\"7eb380164954dfb8\" href=\"?note=7eb380164954dfb8\" title=\"90-df-godel-system\">90-df-godel-system</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Elem(E)</code>、<code>RuleInst_E</code>、<code>Step_E</code></td>\n<td>有限词替换系统、四元规则实例关系、二元一步关系；替换表编码及判定方法显式给出。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-82\" data-note=\"eb8e9519813ba70b\" href=\"?note=eb8e9519813ba70b\" title=\"90-df-elementary-system-definition\">90-df-elementary-system-definition</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-83\" data-note=\"5b263fc62b64e4bb\" href=\"?note=5b263fc62b64e4bb\" title=\"90-df-elementary-system\">90-df-elementary-system</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Creative(C)</code></td>\n<td>c.e.集加补集的全递归生产函数，不把88部分函数版直接代入。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-84\" data-note=\"40041a5a5d6a4573\" href=\"?note=40041a5a5d6a4573\" title=\"90-df-creative-set\">90-df-creative-set</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Simple</code>、<code>Immune</code>、<code>HSimple</code></td>\n<td>原简单性/免疫性/补集主函数非支配性定义；主函数在无限集合上为全函数。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-85\" data-note=\"30f3283b9dedba60\" href=\"?note=30f3283b9dedba60\" title=\"90-df-simple-set\">90-df-simple-set</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-86\" data-note=\"ca9ad86d98eb5bc2\" href=\"?note=ca9ad86d98eb5bc2\" title=\"90-prop-simple-immune\">90-prop-simple-immune</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-87\" data-note=\"a3c41e3442057746\" href=\"?note=a3c41e3442057746\" title=\"90-df-hypersimple-set\">90-df-hypersimple-set</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>mComplete_CE</code></td>\n<td>c.e.类中的多一完全性；归约函数要求全递归。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-88\" data-note=\"fcd465e3faf82dc1\" href=\"?note=fcd465e3faf82dc1\" title=\"90-df-m-complete\">90-df-m-complete</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>递归定理、带参数递归定理</td>\n<td>针对实际可接受编号的外延固定点；带参数版本产生统一递归指标函数。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-89\" data-note=\"40d9084cba778b26\" href=\"?note=40d9084cba778b26\" title=\"90-df-recursion-theorem\">90-df-recursion-theorem</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-90\" data-note=\"0faa654605ca7e90\" href=\"?note=0faa654605ca7e90\" title=\"90-lem-parameterized-recursion\">90-lem-parameterized-recursion</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>K_U</code></td>\n<td>固定最优前缀机的最短描述长度；前缀自由和最优性不是自然语言暗设。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-91\" data-note=\"7d83e22f672cfb25\" href=\"?note=7d83e22f672cfb25\" title=\"90-df-kolmogorov-complexity\">90-df-kolmogorov-complexity</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>b(m)</code>、<code>bin(m)</code></td>\n<td>长度优先字典序下首个复杂度超过m的词及原自定界数值码；次序、二进制图和唯一见证均在正文。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-92\" data-note=\"5cc312c6e3fc50d2\" href=\"?note=5cc312c6e3fc50d2\" title=\"90-ex-berry-paradox-formal\">90-ex-berry-paradox-formal</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Defines</code>、<code>Berry</code></td>\n<td>相对于固定长度和单值定义关系；不把自然语言“最短不可定义者”直接当作已被定义。</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-93\" data-note=\"777baa75a4312c8e\" href=\"?note=777baa75a4312c8e\" title=\"90-df-berry-paradox\">90-df-berry-paradox</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><h2 id=\"跨书与外部依赖\">跨书与外部依赖</h2>\n<p>第88本提供语言/项/公式/代入、结构/满足、机器可计算性、可接受编号、数值归约及唯一描述的已给出接口。必须按各调用文件声明的翻译或参数实例化，不依靠相同字母认定为同一函数。完整对照见 <a href=\"?unresolved=.%2F88-overlap-audit.md\" class=\"wiki-link unresolved\" id=\"ref-94\" data-link-target=\"./88-overlap-audit.md\" data-candidates=\"[]\" title=\"此次发布范围内未找到该目标\">实质重叠与接口差异核查<span class=\"link-suffix\" aria-label=\"未收录\">↗</span></a>。</p>\n<p>原已有但未提供正文的 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-95\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"58-df-omega\">58-df-omega</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-96\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"58-df-relation\">58-df-relation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-97\" data-note=\"9aca87310232fb2f\" href=\"?note=9aca87310232fb2f\" title=\"89-df-hilbert-bernays\">89-df-hilbert-bernays</a> 均保留；本次没有补造外部文本。所有非标准但良定义的90接口以本书原子定义为准，本术语表不以“标准记号”为理由废止它们。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"90-Glossary-—-接口与记号术语表","text":"90 Glossary — 接口与记号术语表","level":1},{"id":"使用约定","text":"使用约定","level":2},{"id":"跨书与外部依赖","text":"跨书与外部依赖","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"使用约定","excerpt":"[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"使用约定","excerpt":"[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"使用约定","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"使用约定","excerpt":"[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"使用约定","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"使用约定","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"5385f3fe07cb98ef","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"使用约定","excerpt":"[[90-df-free-variable]]、[[90-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"使用约定","excerpt":"[[90-df-free-variable]]、[[90-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"使用约定","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":